===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[chalk]] [[up]]|chalks up|chalking up|chalked up}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[attribute]], [[credit]], or [[blame]].
#: '''''Chalk''' it '''up''' to inexperience, I guess, but he made a very poor decision.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} to [[achieve]] something
